{"root":{"children":[{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Bedingungen","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"toc-heading","version":1,"tag":"h1","id":"bedingungen"},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"In Formenio gibt es an verschiedenen Stellen Bedingungen, mit denen sich verschiedene Fälle regeln lassen. Alles ohne Programmierkenntnisse.","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"In Workflows kannst Du mit Bedingungen regeln, wann was ausgeführt wird. So kannst Du beispielsweise eine Email-Adresse dann versenden, wenn ein Feld einen Bestimmten Wert hat oder eine bestimmte Checkbox ausgefüllt ist. Oder trage einen Kunden nur in CleverReach ein, sobald er die jeweilige Checkbox als Einwilligung angeklickt hat!","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Dies lässt sich auch auf Felder anwenden: steuere ganz einfach, welche Felder bei welchen Bedingungen angezeigt werden. Sammle nur die nötigen Daten und halte Formulare so simpel wie möglich!","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Du erstellt Bedingungen immer genau dort, wo sie auch eingesetzt werden. So behälst Du die Kontrolle und hast einen direkten Einblick in die Details.","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Es gibt folgende Bedingungen, die je nach Feldtyp ausgewählt werden können:","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Ist:","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":" Prüft, ob das Feld dem genauen Wert entspricht","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Ist nicht:","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":" Prüft, ob das Feld nicht dem genauen Wert entspricht","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Enthält Text:","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":" Prüft, ob der Text in dem Wert enthalten ist","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Kleiner als:","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":" Prüft, ob der Wert im Feld kleiner ist, als der Wert aus der Bedingung (Aktuell nicht auf Buchstaben anwendbar)","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Größer als:","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":" Prüft, ob der Wert im Feld kleiner ist, als der Wert aus der Bedingung (Aktuell nicht auf Buchstaben anwendbar)","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Enthält","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":": Prüft, ob der Wert des Feldes die angegebenen Zeichen enthält","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Enthält nicht:","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":" Prüft, ob der Wert des Feldes die angegebenen Zeichen nicht enthält","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Ist ausgefüllt: ","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Prüft, ob ein Wert angegeben wurde","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Am / Nicht am / Nach dem / Vor dem:","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":" Datums-Prüfungen","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":1,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Enthält eine von / Enthält alle von / Enthält keine von:","type":"text","version":1},{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":" Prüft, ob der Wert eine / alle oder keine der gewählten Auswahlmöglichkeiten enthält","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":1,"textStyle":""},{"children":[],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""},{"children":[{"detail":0,"format":0,"mode":"normal","style":"","text":"Bedingungen sind hintereinander prüfbar, es können mehrere Bedingungen angelegt werden.","type":"text","version":1}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"paragraph","version":1,"textFormat":0,"textStyle":""}],"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"type":"root","version":1}}